<title>POLAND: HANDLOWY JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 50.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>HANDLOWY JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 50.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 50.64 vs   69.83</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   73.17 vs   94.21</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		110.11 vs   83.36</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     143.14 vs  121.75</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					260.29 vs  390.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  412.16 vs  535.34</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		616.37 vs  559.51</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     871.87 vs  702.21</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Handlowy w</p>
<p>Warszawie SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
